# Rust's std::f64::consts names, exposed as ordinary std functions
# under the owner's no-associated-constants decision (#2285).
## The circle constant pi, rounded to binary64.
## See [std-num.float-math.constant.pi](../../../spec/std/num.md#r-std-num.float-math.constant.pi).
pub fn PI() -> f64:
    3.14159265358979323846264338327950288

## Euler's number, rounded to binary64.
## See [std-num.float-math.constant.e](../../../spec/std/num.md#r-std-num.float-math.constant.e).
pub fn E() -> f64:
    2.71828182845904523536028747135266250
